                                "sense_id": "8bb7e8b8-3984-33f4-825a-34ffb32d1c8d",
                                "text": "Indeed Erskine never opened his mouth, in Watt's presence, except to eat, or belch, or cough, or keck, or muse, or sigh, or sing, or sneeze."
